This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by AVerMedia
Technologies, Inc. "AVerMedia", "Live Streamer" and "AX310" are used only to say
which hardware this software talks to. No vendor firmware, driver, software or
other material is included or redistributed here.

The protocol was worked out by observing USB traffic between the vendor's own
software and the device -- black-box observation of an interface, for the sole
purpose of interoperating with hardware its owner already bought. The register
addresses and byte layouts recorded in this repository are facts about that
interface.

