Bundled typefaces, compiled into the binary as Qt resources. Both are under the
SIL Open Font License 1.1, whose text ships beside them in src/gui/fonts/ and is
installed with the package:

  Barlow Condensed          OFL-1.1  src/gui/fonts/OFL-BarlowCondensed.txt
  JetBrains Mono Nerd Font  OFL-1.1  src/gui/fonts/OFL-JetBrainsMono.txt

The JetBrains Mono files here are subsets: the Latin set and the six icons the
interface draws are kept, and several thousand glyphs for tools this project will
never mention are dropped.
